[h2]First release[/h2]

[list]
[*]The Magocracy government, founded by a Magister ruler.
[*]Warmage, Arcane and Merchant-Mage Magocracies.
[*]Conclave laws for composition, authority and voting.
[*]Magocratic Election and Magocratic Appointment succession.
[*]The Mage's Commune, with its own buildings, events, decisions and raids.
[*]Ten magic decrees.
[*]The Valyrian District and four Valyrian great projects.
[*]Built for CK3 1.21.
[/list]
